// ฟังก์ชันสำหรับวาดกล่องป้ายสถานะ (ONLINE/OFFLINE Badge Box) แบบอินไลน์
void drawInlineStatusBadge(int x, int y) {
  int badgeW = 66;
  int badgeH = 16;
  int badgeY = y - (badgeH / 2);
  
  if (WiFi.status() == WL_CONNECTED) {
    tft.fillRoundRect(x, badgeY, badgeW, badgeH, 4, TFT_DARKGREEN);
    tft.drawRoundRect(x, badgeY, badgeW, badgeH, 4, TFT_GREEN);
    tft.setTextColor(TFT_WHITE, TFT_DARKGREEN);
    tft.setTextDatum(MC_DATUM);
    tft.drawString("ONLINE", x + (badgeW / 2), y, 2);
  } else {
    tft.fillRoundRect(x, badgeY, badgeW, badgeH, 4, TFT_MAROON);
    tft.drawRoundRect(x, badgeY, badgeW, badgeH, 4, TFT_RED);
    tft.setTextColor(TFT_WHITE, TFT_MAROON);
    tft.setTextDatum(MC_DATUM);
    tft.drawString("OFFLINE", x + (badgeW / 2), y, 2);
  }
}

